<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Cell Biol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">jcb</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of Cell Biology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0021-9525</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-8140</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2064682</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">200509115520061120c</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1083/jcb.200509115520061120c</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>James E.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Snow</surname><given-names>Joshua J.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Gunnarson</surname><given-names>Amy L.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Ou</surname><given-names>Guangshuo</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Stahlberg</surname><given-names>Henning</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>McDonald</surname><given-names>Kent L.</given-names></name></contrib><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Scholey</surname><given-names>Jonathan M.</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><day>4</day><month>12</month><year>2006</year></pub-date><volume>175</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>837</fpage><lpage>837</lpage><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2006, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2006</copyright-year><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:href="jcb1750837.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 172 No. 5, February 27, 2006. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="172" page="663" id="N0x8c5d2e0N0x9ba5d80" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="16492809" ext-link-type="pubmed">663&#x02013;669</related-article>.</p><p>In <xref rid="fig1" ref-type="fig">Fig. 2</xref> of the original paper, the &#x0201c;Transition&#x0201d; images for <italic>klp-11</italic> and <italic>che-3</italic> were erroneously duplicated. The corrected <italic>che-3</italic> panel appears in the image below. Although this error did not compromise the overall conclusions of the paper, the authors wish to apologize for their mistake.</p><fig position="float" id="fig1"><label>Figure 1</label><graphic xlink:href="jcb1750837f02"></graphic></fig></body></article>